ad from Nuvolari.","q":false,"c":5},{"lap":15,"text":"On lap 15, Varzi headed for his pit where he retired with a broken leaf spring. Zehender was the first to stop at the pits for new tires.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":8},{"lap":15,"text":"On lap 15, Varzi headed for his pit where he retired with a broken leaf spring. Zehender was the first to stop at the pits for new tires.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":8},{"lap":17,"text":"After 17 laps, Nuvolari had regained the lead. The struggle at the front was superb.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":1},{"lap":17,"text":"After 17 laps, Nuvolari had regained the lead. The struggle at the front was superb.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":1},{"lap":18,"text":"Lehoux had been with the leading group since the beginning but had slowly fallen behind to retire after an oil pipe broke.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":12},{"lap":18,"text":"Lehoux had been with the leading group since the beginning but had slowly fallen behind to retire after an oil pipe broke.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":12},{"lap":20,"text":"On lap 20, Dreyfus retired when a tire blew out causing his car to leave the track and end up in the ditch without him sustaining injury.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":7},{"lap":20,"text":"After 100 km Fagioli leads.","q":false,"c":5},{"lap":20,"text":"On lap 20, Dreyfus retired when a tire blew out causing his car to leave the track and end up in the ditch without him sustaining injury.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":7},{"lap":20,"text":"After 100 km Fagioli leads.","q":false,"c":5},{"lap":25,"text":"On lap 25 Nuvolari was leading once again ahead of Fagioli and Gaupillat. These drivers put up a stiff fight and all three were separated by just a few meters.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":1},{"lap":25,"text":"On lap 25 Nuvolari was leading once again ahead of Fagioli and Gaupillat. These drivers put up a stiff fight and all three were separated by just a few meters.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":1},{"lap":32,"text":"Falchetto retired after 31 laps. When Gaupillat headed for the pits to change tires after 32 laps, Nuvolari and Fagioli were the only ones left at the front.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":4},{"lap":32,"text":"Falchetto retired after 31 laps. When Gaupillat headed for the pits to change tires after 32 laps, Nuvolari and Fagioli were the only ones left at the front.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":4},{"lap":37,"text":"At mid race, Nuvolari was still in the lead while Fagioli had fallen behind when he stopped for three minutes to refuel, change tires and check a steering problem. Sommer now found himself in second place.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":5},{"lap":37,"text":"At mid race, Nuvolari was still in the lead while Fagioli had fallen behind when he stopped for three minutes to refuel, change tires and check a steering problem. Sommer now found himself in second place.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":5},{"lap":41,"text":"Chiron and Hell\u00e9 Nice, who had struggled with tire problems and an oil leak, disappeared on lap 41, reducing the field to seven cars.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":10},{"lap":41,"text":"Chiron and Hell\u00e9 Nice, who had struggled with tire problems and an oil leak, disappeared on lap 41, reducing the field to seven cars.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":10},{"lap":43,"text":"Zehender cannot restart after refuelling; he is push-started, briefly stopped by race management, and Toselli takes over.","q":false,"c":3},{"lap":43,"text":"Zehender cannot restart after refuelling; he is push-started, briefly stopped by race management, and Toselli takes over.","q":false,"c":3},{"lap":48,"text":"Nuvolari makes a leisurely stop for fuel, wheels, plugs and a drink, though only 1m20s ahead of Sommer.","q":false,"c":1},{"lap":48,"text":"Nuvolari makes a leisurely stop for fuel, wheels, plugs and a drink, though only 1m20s ahead of Sommer.","q":false,"c":1},{"lap":49,"text":"When Sommer headed for the pits, he only filled up with fuel and as a result moved into first place.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":0},{"lap":49,"text":"When Sommer headed for the pits, he only filled up with fuel and as a result moved into first place.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":0},{"lap":50,"text":"After 250 km Sommer leads Nuvolari, Gaupillat and Moll.","q":false,"c":0},{"lap":50,"text":"After 250 km Sommer leads Nuvolari, Gaupillat and Moll.","q":false,"c":0},{"lap":51,"text":"The Alfa pits signal Nuvolari to go faster; he stops to find out why, then sets off after Sommer at a frightening pace.","q":false,"c":1},{"lap":51,"text":"The Alfa pits signal Nuvolari to go faster; he stops to find out why, then sets off after Sommer at a frightening pace.","q":false,"c":1},{"lap":53,"text":"Chasing Sommer, Nuvolari sets a new lap record at 199.741 km/h.","q":false,"c":1},{"lap":53,"text":"Chasing Sommer, Nuvolari sets a new lap record at 199.741 km/h.","q":false,"c":1},{"lap":60,"text":"After 60 laps at 300 km Sommer was leading in 1h42m43s, a speed of 175.239 km/h. Nuvolari was second with 1h44m49s.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":0},{"lap":60,"text":"After 60 laps at 300 km Sommer was leading in 1h42m43s, a speed of 175.239 km/h. Nuvolari was second with 1h44m49s.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":0},{"lap":68,"text":"On lap 68 the Frenchman was forced to stop but the tire change went quick enough, so that he did not lose the lead.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":0},{"lap":68,"text":"On lap 68 the Frenchman was forced to stop but the tire change went quick enough, so that he did not lose the lead.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":0},{"lap":70,"text":"After 70 laps at 350 km Sommer remained in first place at 2h1m39s, now only 46 seconds ahead of Nuvolari.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":0},{"lap":70,"text":"After 70 laps at 350 km Sommer remained in first place at 2h1m39s, now only 46 seconds ahead of Nuvolari.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":0},{"lap":75,"text":"Five l